# Keep the Docker build context to what the image build reads (infra/docker/Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

.git
.github
.vscode
.crew
docs
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Compose, manifests, and docs are not needed to build images.
docker-compose*.yml
infra/k8s
infra/traefik
README.md
